      "quote": "According to NVIDIA, Physical AI lets autonomous systems like cameras, robots, and self-driving cars perceive, understand, reason, and perform or orchestrate complex actions in the physical world.\nOur characterization\nFour necessary properties of a Physical AI system\nAny intelligent system interacting with the physical world must be able to (i) acquire information from\nits environment, (ii) reason over this information to support decision-making, and (iii) act upon the\nenvironment to exert influ",
      "before": "ctions with the real world.\n### The physical counterpart of digital AI\nIndustry view · NVIDIA\nAI that understands and acts in the physical world\n### AI that understands and acts in the physical world\n",
